  "input": "Which note corrected the recorded owner of the scheduler, and when?\n[2025-09-05] handover/2025-09-05-scheduler-correction: Correction to the handover note of 2025-08-29: the scheduler went to Atlas, not team Cinder. Team Cinder never owned it; the note was written against the wrong team. [2025-08-29] handover/2025-08-29-scheduler: Ownership change: the scheduler now sits with team Cinder. Ember no longer owns it. [2025-10-15] handover/2025-10-15-scheduler: From today the pager for scheduler rings Dune, not team Atlas. Ownership transferred.",
